## 📝 Typography System

### Font Hierarchy
Following the client's preference for display fonts in headers and sans-serif for body text.

#### Headers & Titles
- **Font Family:** Shabnam (Persian) / SF Pro Display (Latin)
- **Weights:** Regular (400), Medium (500), Bold (700)
- **Usage:** Page titles, section headers, brand elements

#### Body Text
- **Font Family:** Inter / SF Pro Text
- **Weights:** Regular (400), Medium (500), SemiBold (600)
- **Usage:** All body text, buttons, navigation, forms

### Type Scale
```
H1 (Page Titles): 28px / Bold / Charcoal
H2 (Section Headers): 24px / Bold / Charcoal  
H3 (Subsections): 20px / Medium / Charcoal
H4 (Card Titles): 18px / Medium / Charcoal
Body Large: 16px / Regular / Charcoal
Body Regular: 14px / Regular / Medium Gray
Body Small: 12px / Regular / Medium Gray
Caption: 11px / Regular / Medium Gray
```

