## 🎭 Animation & Micro-Interactions

### Loading States
- **Page Loading:** KimLand logo with subtle pulse animation
- **Content Loading:** Skeleton screens in brand colors
- **Button Loading:** Spinner with primary color
- **Image Loading:** Blur-to-sharp transition

### Transitions
- **Page Transitions:** Slide from right (iOS style)
- **Modal Appearance:** Scale up from 95% with opacity
- **Cart Updates:** Bounce animation for quantity changes
- **Success States:** Checkmark animation in KimLand Green

### Feedback Animations
- **Button Press:** Scale down to 96% on touch
- **Favorite Toggle:** Heart fill animation
- **Add to Cart:** Product image flies to cart icon
- **Pull to Refresh:** Custom animation with brand elements

